      "id": "claim_e4d3f9de0ea246b283389ce16356c313",
      "statement": "The run fingerprint payload is the whole configuration minus a denylist of non-scoring sections (currently only `paths`), so every scoring section changes the hash and a configuration section added later is covered without editing config_hash — replacing an allowlist design that had to be remembered whenever the schema grew.",
