      "statement": "Whole-configuration coverage is deliberately over-sensitive: config_hash is used only by `run`, so a golden-only change alters a run fingerprint even though golden settings cannot affect run scoring — accepted because a false 'different' merely prompts a second look while a false 'same' silently licenses comparing incomparable score files.",
